    <!-- Los dialogos de informacion -->
    <string name="info_button">ⓘ</string>
    <string name="info_habits_title">About habits</string>
    <string name="info_habits_body">You write them yourself: daily, or X times a week.\n\nA weekly one is judged by whether you are on pace, not by today: that way the gym does not punish rest days.\n\nStreak in days if daily, in weeks if weekly.\n\nFalling behind slows you down: from ×0.21 to ×2.9.</string>
    <string name="info_sleep_title">About sleep</string>
    <string name="info_sleep_body">7–9 h is the usual recommendation. Default: 7 h 30.\n\nScore = 70 %% how much you slept + 30 %% punctuality.\n\nMeasured with the screen off. It counts the longest stretch, not the total.\n\nNot medical advice.</string>
    <string name="info_water_title">About water</string>
    <string name="info_water_body">~2 L a day gets quoted a lot, but it depends on you. Change it.\n\nEach tap adds one serving (a glass ≈ 250 ml).\n\nThe reward is paid tomorrow: that way it rewards the whole day, not one big gulp.\n\nNot medical advice.</string>

